  <item rdf:about="https://www.technologyreview.com/2026/07/01/1140003/llms-are-stuck-in-a-groupthink-rut-this-startup-is-trying-to-get-them-out/">
    <title>LLMs are stuck in a groupthink groove. This startup is trying to get them out.</title>
